@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Student

component "Web Interface" as WebUI
component "Flask API" as API
component "StudyPlanGenerator" as SPG
artifact "JSON Study Plan" as JSON

Student --> WebUI : enters preferences\nrequests plan
WebUI --> API : HTTP(S) request
API --> SPG : generatePlan(input)
SPG --> API : plan JSON
API --> WebUI : HTTP response (JSON)
WebUI --> Student : displays study plan
API --> JSON : outputs/returns

@enduml
